            A
            %em morphism of cowreaths
            is a 1-cell
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi f
                  %mo ,
                  %mi ϕ
                  %mo ,
                  %mover
                    %mi ϕ
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ¯
