          %p
            The pair
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi f
                  %mo ,
                  %mi ϕ
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo ,
                  %mover
                    %mi ϕ
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ¯
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} ((f,\phi), \bar \phi)
            is then required to satisfy the axioms of 1-cell in
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi KL
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} KL
